\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S1}{\ignorespaces Rapid-distortion limit (eddy events suppressed, inviscid) against the analytic reference of \citet  {LeePiomelliReynolds1986} used by \citet  {ChenMeneveauKatz2006}. (\textit  {a}) Component spectral-centroid migration follows the rigid-translation law, reaching the deformation ratio $D=3$ at the end of the straining phase. (\textit  {b}) Kinetic-energy amplification: the solver follows the closure trajectory, within $2\%$ of the exact rapid-distortion value at $e=2.20$.}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
